* Original POLY(3) modulation law: VAM=Vc*(0.6+0.1*V1)
VMOD mod 0 PULSE(0 4 25u 20n 20n 4.96e-06 50u)
BAM out 0 V=(0.6+0.1*v(mod))*sin(2*pi*31e6*time)
RL out 0 2000
CL out 0 10p
.options method=trap maxord=2 reltol=1e-5 trtol=7
.control
set filetype=binary
save v(out) v(mod)
tran 0.5n 130u 0 0.5n
write D:/实验报告文件夹/电路2/simulation/v4_hardware/stage4_rf_oscillator/AM01_2N3904_20261113/results/raw/poly_rl2000_d10_a4.raw
quit
.endc
.end
